WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.791
Did they offer you drinks?

00:00:01.791 --> 00:00:02.875
No - is this real?

00:00:02.875 --> 00:00:05.333
Would you like a scotch, or there’s
apple juice if you’d rather?

00:00:05.333 --> 00:00:07.500
I think Ardbeg would be
the right answer.

00:00:08.375 --> 00:00:10.541
That’s my son!

00:00:15.916 --> 00:00:18.166
Wolf - you’re home.

00:00:19.083 --> 00:00:19.916
Finally.

00:00:19.916 --> 00:00:21.541
Vesemir…

00:00:22.250 --> 00:00:23.625
Yeah.

00:00:25.541 --> 00:00:27.500
 I had to make a few stops.

00:00:28.041 --> 00:00:30.833
You made this really special for me,

00:00:30.833 --> 00:00:34.833
because of the conversations that we 
had about character,

00:00:34.833 --> 00:00:38.000
and creating this
soulfulness and depth,

00:00:38.000 --> 00:00:41.708
so you’ve made this a family for me,

00:00:41.708 --> 00:00:45.250
where before I was just a lonely
witcher, all by my lonesome.

00:00:45.250 --> 00:00:51.000
I was looking at you before
I met you in your earlier interviews

00:00:51.000 --> 00:00:53.875
about how much you love
The Witcher world.

00:00:53.875 --> 00:00:56.875
And you told me that you
wanted to travel inside your

00:00:56.875 --> 00:01:00.291
emotional knowledge
that you have with Geralt.

00:01:00.291 --> 00:01:02.125
And for me,
that’s everything, you know,

00:01:02.125 --> 00:01:04.708
that’s my skills, I love that.

00:01:04.708 --> 00:01:06.750
And you brought it, you brought it.

00:01:06.750 --> 00:01:09.000
But that’s why it was easy
for me to tell about

00:01:09.000 --> 00:01:12.916
what I thought were the elements
of the grounding in Vesemir.

00:01:12.916 --> 00:01:15.208
I lived in the forest for twenty years-

00:01:15.208 --> 00:01:16.458
Yes, yeah, you told me.

00:01:16.458 --> 00:01:20.958
 - and when I was done telling you
about my antics travelling,

00:01:20.958 --> 00:01:23.625
and how it is to really be alone…

00:01:23.625 --> 00:01:28.083
you said, “You are Vesemir.”

00:01:28.083 --> 00:01:33.041
You were the last surviving witcher
after Kaer Morhen fell.

00:01:33.041 --> 00:01:36.333
You and a batch of mutated orphans,

00:01:36.333 --> 00:01:38.083
with nowhere else to go.

00:01:40.458 --> 00:01:42.041
Were you ready?

00:01:42.041 --> 00:01:43.125
No.

00:01:43.125 --> 00:01:44.958
But you protected us anyway.

00:01:44.958 --> 00:01:49.291
No. I taught you how
to fend for yourselves.

00:01:49.291 --> 00:01:51.875
I trained everyday
in a new way of crying.

00:01:51.875 --> 00:01:55.583
And that’s why I have to
travel inside my life

00:01:55.583 --> 00:01:58.166
all the time because you don’t know
if there is more to cry about,

00:01:58.166 --> 00:01:58.666
you know.

00:01:58.666 --> 00:02:01.375
This is - I have this thing,
yes, absolutely.

00:02:02.750 --> 00:02:05.291
I…once I’ve used something,
I’ve used it.

00:02:05.291 --> 00:02:05.708
Yeah!

00:02:05.708 --> 00:02:06.625
And then I’ve dealt with it.

00:02:06.625 --> 00:02:07.125
Yeah!

00:02:07.125 --> 00:02:10.500
I’ve emotionally processed it,
because I’ve been crying all day on set.

00:02:10.500 --> 00:02:13.500
When I do this travelling all
the time it’s like my body

00:02:13.500 --> 00:02:14.875
is getting more and more healthy.

00:02:14.875 --> 00:02:15.416
Right.

00:02:15.416 --> 00:02:17.958
So I’ve always thought…

00:02:17.958 --> 00:02:21.875
that being an actor
is also healing myself,

00:02:21.875 --> 00:02:24.083
it’s like to be a better person.

00:02:24.083 --> 00:02:26.833
I think that’s the most
important thing for me

00:02:26.833 --> 00:02:29.000
is to be a better person every day.

00:02:29.000 --> 00:02:31.083
You did what you had to do.

00:02:31.083 --> 00:02:32.375
You truly are Vesemir,

00:02:32.375 --> 00:02:35.791
it’s the soul you bring
into the character,

00:02:35.791 --> 00:02:37.833
that soulfulness which…

00:02:37.833 --> 00:02:41.250
speaking specifically about the
relationship between Geralt and Vesemir,

00:02:41.250 --> 00:02:46.250
they are incredibly emotional
with one another, and soulful,

00:02:46.250 --> 00:02:48.625
but they’re so sad.

00:02:48.625 --> 00:02:54.083
There’s such a deep sorrow in
Kaer Morhen because these are the last,

00:02:54.083 --> 00:02:56.916
and each year less come back.

00:02:56.916 --> 00:03:01.041
And these two incredibly
dangerous individuals

00:03:01.041 --> 00:03:03.541
who are capable of
such extreme violence

00:03:03.541 --> 00:03:06.083
and have survived extreme violence.

00:03:06.083 --> 00:03:09.916
I know in some scenes
they didn’t make the cut,

00:03:09.916 --> 00:03:12.291
but the softness we brought
and that connection,

00:03:12.291 --> 00:03:14.458
just resting our heads
against each other’s heads,

00:03:14.458 --> 00:03:17.958
and it just made so much sense, 

00:03:17.958 --> 00:03:19.791
because you can’t really fake that. 

00:03:19.791 --> 00:03:22.875
That’s why I love these moments
as an actor

00:03:22.875 --> 00:03:25.250
where we can time travel
inside our minds.

00:03:25.250 --> 00:03:26.625
Isn’t that beautiful?

00:03:26.625 --> 00:03:27.333
It is beautiful. 

00:03:27.333 --> 00:03:31.625
And it’s so good to have someone
opposite you, who does it with you.

00:03:31.625 --> 00:03:32.666
Yeah, yeah I know.

00:03:32.666 --> 00:03:35.625
Like that moment in, um, the caves…

00:03:36.916 --> 00:03:38.750
And it was very emotional. 

00:03:38.750 --> 00:03:39.375
It was.

00:03:39.375 --> 00:03:42.125
It was beautiful, I don’t know
which version they chose, but…

00:03:42.125 --> 00:03:44.250
I know, I know, and I also knew -

00:03:44.250 --> 00:03:47.625
I mean I knew what they were
choosing but I…

00:03:47.625 --> 00:03:50.750
you asked me to get emotional,

00:03:50.750 --> 00:03:53.500
and you wanted Geralt
 to be emotional this year,

00:03:53.500 --> 00:03:59.875
and we talked a lot about how difficult
it is for us actors to put it in in serials

00:03:59.875 --> 00:04:01.625
or in movies because you know,

00:04:01.625 --> 00:04:05.166
we are not always allowed
to show so much emotion.

00:04:05.166 --> 00:04:08.833
So the balance is
how much will be in the show,

00:04:08.833 --> 00:04:10.666
and how much will not be in the show.

00:04:10.666 --> 00:04:14.958
But for me, if you let yourself
do it on set,

00:04:14.958 --> 00:04:16.208
the energy will be there,

00:04:16.208 --> 00:04:18.125
and it will be inside you and inside me,

00:04:18.125 --> 00:04:20.708
and that’s why I went the whole way!

00:04:20.708 --> 00:04:21.375
Yes.

00:04:21.375 --> 00:04:23.083
Also because I knew -

00:04:23.083 --> 00:04:23.791
Yes.

00:04:24.416 --> 00:04:26.500
- we had to follow you in that scene.

00:04:27.333 --> 00:04:31.250
So I knew that whatever I do in front
of the body of one of my sons,

00:04:31.250 --> 00:04:33.750
that the camera would be on your face.

00:04:33.750 --> 00:04:39.458
So if I was crying out - the whole day -
really deep inside crying out,

00:04:39.458 --> 00:04:43.833
I knew I could put some
beautiful feelings inside you,

00:04:43.833 --> 00:04:46.208
and the camera would see it,

00:04:46.208 --> 00:04:50.250
because you couldn’t resist it
because it’s a sound.

00:04:50.916 --> 00:04:52.458
It’s a primal reaction. Yeah.

00:04:52.458 --> 00:04:57.000
Exactly! But that trust is the most
important thing we can have, you know.

00:04:57.916 --> 00:05:03.541
I know you think I’m mad,
 but I need to know what happened.

00:05:04.166 --> 00:05:10.041
If it were your child, you’d be
going crazy to figure it out.

00:05:10.041 --> 00:05:11.000
Thanks for watching,

00:05:11.000 --> 00:05:12.250
thanks for watching our little chit chat.

00:05:12.250 --> 00:05:16.208
This is basically an inside look into
what we did everyday on set,

00:05:16.208 --> 00:05:19.833
and I hope you enjoy
watching The Witcher Season 2.

